    {
      "number": "711",
      "text": "711. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u6570\u7684\u6574\u6570\u90e8\u5206\uff1a\na) $\\sqrt{2}$ \u548c $-\\sqrt{2}$\uff1b\nb) $\\sqrt{13}$ \u548c $-\\sqrt{13}$\uff1b\nc) $\\sqrt{47}$ \u548c $-\\sqrt{47}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "712",
      "text": "712. \u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\na) $\\{[17.3]\\}$\uff1b\nb) $[\\{-25.7\\}]$\uff1b\nc) $\\{[15]\\}$\uff1b\nd) $[\\{23\\}]$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "713",
      "text": "713. \u5199\u51fa\u4f7f\u4e0b\u5217\u4e0d\u7b49\u5f0f\u6210\u7acb\u7684\u53d8\u91cf $a$ \u7684\u51e0\u4e2a\u503c\uff1a\na) $\\{a\\}<0.15$\uff1b\nb) $\\{a\\}>\\frac{2}{3}$\uff1b\nc) $\\{a\\}+0.05>\\{a+0.05\\}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "714",
      "text": "714. \u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\na) $[2.75+x]=[2.75]$\uff1b\nb) $\\{2.75+x\\}=\\{2.75\\}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "715",
      "text": "715. \u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\na) $[0.21+x]=[0.21]$\uff1b\nb) $[y-0.36]=[2.4]$\uff1b\nc) $[1.7+z]=[-8.2]$\uff1b\nd) $\\{0.58+x\\}=0.58$\uff1b\ne) $\\{y-0.39\\}=0.61$\uff1b\nf) $\\{1.62+x\\}=0.65$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "716",
      "text": "716. \u6307\u51fa\u4f7f\u4e0b\u5217\u7b49\u5f0f\u4e0d\u6210\u7acb\u7684\u53d8\u91cf $x$ \u7684\u4efb\u4f55\u4e00\u4e2a\u503c\uff1a\na) $\\{5.41+x\\}=\\{5.41\\}+\\{x\\}$\uff1b\nb) $[2x]=2[x]$.",
